<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id" dir="ltr" data-bs-theme="light" data-color-theme="Blue_Theme" data-layout="vertical">

<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="IE=edge" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />

  <link rel="shortcut icon" type="image/x-icon" href="/public/assets/images/logos/favicon.ico" />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/public/assets/css/styles.css" />

  <title>404 - Halaman Tidak Ditemukan | S.UNJANI</title>

  <style>
    :root {
      --page-bg-start: #f4f9ff;
      --page-bg-end: #f1f8f2;
      --card-bg: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.78);
      --card-border: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.56);
      --text-main: #17233b;
      --text-muted: #5d6778;
      --brand: #0f7f4f;
      --brand-deep: #0a5f3b;
      --soft-shadow: 0 20px 55px rgba(13, 33, 56, 0.16);
    }

    body {
      min-height: 100vh;
      font-family: "Plus Jakarta Sans", "Nunito Sans", "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
      color: var(--text-main);
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at 8% 12%, rgba(77, 144, 254, 0.2), transparent 34%),
        radial-gradient(circle at 88% 10%, rgba(15, 127, 79, 0.18), transparent 37%),
        radial-gradient(circle at 50% 92%, rgba(255, 198, 102, 0.2), transparent 40%),
        linear-gradient(135deg, var(--page-bg-start), var(--page-bg-end));
    }

    .error-shell {
      position: relative;
      min-height: 100vh;
      width: 100%;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: clamp(1.25rem, 2vw, 2rem);
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .blob {
      position: absolute;
      border-radius: 50%;
      filter: blur(10px);
      opacity: 0.45;
      pointer-events: none;
      animation: floatBlob 7s ease-in-out infinite;
    }

    .blob-a {
      width: 240px;
      height: 240px;
      left: -70px;
      top: 10%;
      background: #91c4ff;
    }

    .blob-b {
      width: 200px;
      height: 200px;
      right: -70px;
      top: 18%;
      background: #9be3b6;
      animation-delay: 1.5s;
    }

    .blob-c {
      width: 230px;
      height: 230px;
      right: 20%;
      bottom: -90px;
      background: #ffd28b;
      animation-delay: 0.8s;
    }

    .error-card {
      width: min(980px, 100%);
      border: 1px solid var(--card-border);
      border-radius: 28px;
      padding: clamp(1.35rem, 3vw, 2.5rem);
      background: var(--card-bg);
      backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
      box-shadow: var(--soft-shadow);
      position: relative;
      z-index: 2;
    }

    .error-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.04fr) minmax(0, 0.96fr);
      align-items: center;
      gap: clamp(1.2rem, 3vw, 2.4rem);
    }

    .eyebrow {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 0.38rem 0.78rem;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: rgba(15, 127, 79, 0.11);
      color: var(--brand);
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .title {
      margin: 0 0 0.9rem;
      font-size: clamp(1.85rem, 3.2vw, 2.85rem);
      line-height: 1.16;
      font-weight: 800;
    }

    .desc {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      font-size: clamp(0.96rem, 1.75vw, 1.08rem);
      line-height: 1.74;
      max-width: 52ch;
    }

    .action-group {
      margin-top: 1.55rem;
      display: flex;
      gap: 0.82rem;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .btn-brand {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--brand), var(--brand-deep));
      border: none;
      color: #fff;
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 0.75rem 1.08rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      transition: transform 0.22s ease, box-shadow 0.22s ease;
      box-shadow: 0 12px 24px rgba(15, 127, 79, 0.28);
    }

    .btn-brand:hover {
      color: #fff;
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      box-shadow: 0 15px 30px rgba(15, 127, 79, 0.33);
    }

    .btn-ghost {
      border-radius: 12px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(23, 35, 59, 0.14);
      padding: 0.75rem 1.08rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--text-main);
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.62);
      transition: all 0.2s ease;
    }

    .btn-ghost:hover {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.96);
      border-color: rgba(23, 35, 59, 0.24);
      color: var(--text-main);
      transform: translateY(-2px);
    }

    .quick-links {
      margin-top: 1.25rem;
      display: flex;
      gap: 0.65rem;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .quick-links a {
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 0.82rem;
      color: #234264;
      background: rgba(35, 66, 100, 0.08);
      border: 1px solid rgba(35, 66, 100, 0.11);
      border-radius: 999px;
      padding: 0.38rem 0.7rem;
      transition: all 0.2s ease;
    }

    .quick-links a:hover {
      color: #fff;
      background: #234264;
      border-color: #234264;
    }

    .helper-text {
      margin: 1rem 0 0;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      font-size: 0.87rem;
    }

    .visual-panel {
      position: relative;
      border-radius: 22px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(23, 35, 59, 0.1);
      background: linear-gradient(150deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85), rgba(248, 253, 249, 0.72));
      padding: clamp(1rem, 2.4vw, 1.5rem);
      overflow: hidden;
      min-height: 360px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.9rem;
      isolation: isolate;
    }

    .status-chip {
      align-self: flex-start;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #1a6b46;
      background: rgba(26, 107, 70, 0.12);
      border: 1px solid rgba(26, 107, 70, 0.24);
      border-radius: 999px;
      padding: 0.32rem 0.7rem;
    }

    .code-number {
      font-size: clamp(3rem, 8.5vw, 4.8rem);
      line-height: 1;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
      margin: 0;
      color: rgba(23, 35, 59, 0.15);
      user-select: none;
    }

    .error-illustration {
      width: min(360px, 100%);
      position: relative;
      z-index: 2;
      animation: floatCard 5s ease-in-out infinite;
    }

    .ring {
      position: absolute;
      border-radius: 50%;
      border: 1px dashed rgba(26, 107, 70, 0.26);
      pointer-events: none;
      z-index: 1;
      animation: pulseRing 4s ease-in-out infinite;
    }

    .ring-a {
      width: 170px;
      height: 170px;
      right: 9%;
      top: 17%;
    }

    .ring-b {
      width: 116px;
      height: 116px;
      left: 8%;
      bottom: 14%;
      animation-delay: 1.2s;
    }

    @media (max-width: 991.98px) {
      .error-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .visual-panel {
        min-height: 310px;
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 575.98px) {
      .error-card {
        border-radius: 22px;
      }

      .action-group {
        flex-direction: column;
      }

      .action-group .btn {
        width: 100%;
      }
    }

    @keyframes floatBlob {
      0%, 100% {
        transform: translateY(0px);
      }
      50% {
        transform: translateY(-14px);
      }
    }

    @keyframes floatCard {
      0%, 100% {
        transform: translateY(0px);
      }
      50% {
        transform: translateY(-8px);
      }
    }

    @keyframes pulseRing {
      0%, 100% {
        transform: scale(1);
        opacity: 0.75;
      }
      50% {
        transform: scale(1.08);
        opacity: 0.35;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <div class="preloader">
    <img src="/public/assets/images/logos/favicon.png" alt="loader" class="lds-ripple img-fluid" />
  </div>

  <div id="main-wrapper">
    <main class="error-shell">
      <span class="blob blob-a" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <span class="blob blob-b" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <span class="blob blob-c" aria-hidden="true"></span>

      <section class="error-card" aria-labelledby="title-404">
        <div class="error-grid">
          <div class="content-panel">
            <span class="eyebrow">Error 404</span>
            <h1 id="title-404" class="title">Halaman yang Anda cari tidak ditemukan.</h1>
            <p class="desc">
              Tautan mungkin sudah dipindahkan, dihapus, atau URL yang dimasukkan belum tepat.
              Gunakan tombol di bawah untuk kembali ke halaman utama atau menghubungi tim kami.
            </p>

            <div class="action-group">
              <a class="btn btn-brand" href="/" role="button">Kembali ke Beranda</a>
              <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/contact" role="button">Hubungi Kami</a>
            </div>

            <div class="quick-links">
              <a href="/about">Tentang S.UNJANI</a>
              <a href="/apps">Aplikasi & Update</a>
              <a href="/login">Masuk Akun</a>
            </div>

            <p class="helper-text">Tip: periksa kembali ejaan URL jika Anda mengetiknya secara manual.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="visual-panel">
            <span class="status-chip">S.UNJANI Web</span>
            <p class="code-number">404</p>
            <img src="/public/assets/images/backgrounds/errorimg.svg" alt="Ilustrasi halaman tidak ditemukan"
              class="img-fluid error-illustration" />
            <span class="ring ring-a" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <span class="ring ring-b" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>
  </div>

  <div class="dark-transparent sidebartoggler"></div>

  <script src="/public/assets/libs/bootstrap/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>
  <script src="/public/assets/libs/simplebar/dist/simplebar.min.js"></script>
  <script src="/public/assets/js/theme/app.init.js"></script>
  <script src="/public/assets/js/theme/theme.js"></script>
  <script src="/public/assets/js/theme/app.min.js"></script>
</body>

</html>
